msgstr "Caution: “{name}” is also installed as {source} – this is an additional copy placed there by hand"

#: cachy_kompass/sources/files.py:192
msgid "Dieses Programm. Wurde mit install.sh in deinen Benutzerordner installiert. Aktualisieren: im heruntergeladenen Ordner „git pull“ und danach „./install.sh“."
msgstr "This program. Installed into your home folder with install.sh. To update: run “git pull” and then “./install.sh” in the downloaded folder."

